* LT3045-1 3.3V LDO Regulator
VIN IN 0 5
CIN IN 0 10u

* LT3045-1 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pins: IN, EN/UV, PG, ILIM, VIOC, SET, GND, OUTS, OUT
X1 IN IN NC_PG 0 0 SET 0 OUT OUT LT3045-1

* Pull-up for Power Good (PG) to avoid floating node
RPG IN NC_PG 100k

* SET pin programming: 100uA * 33k = 3.3V
RSET SET 0 33k
* Small SET capacitor for fast simulation startup (~0.33ms)
CSET SET 0 10n

* Output capacitor (10uF minimum required for stability)
COUT OUT 0 10u

* 100mA Resistive Load (3.3V / 100mA = 33 Ohms)
RLOAD OUT 0 33

* Transient analysis to allow the output to settle
.tran 10m
.end
